  "notes": [
    "**Ahogar** is a regular **-AR verb** with a spelling change",
    "Spelling change: g→gu before é (ahogué, not \"ahogé\") - same pattern as apagar, llegar, naufragar",
    "This spelling change only affects the \"yo\" form in preterite",
    "Often used reflexively: *ahogarse* (to drown)",
